</svg></div>                        </a></div><div class="d-md-flex align-items-center justify-content-end position-static flex-1 header-right-wrapper"><div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-between align-items-end m-wrapper-outer ml-auto"><div class="imh"><div id="navbarNavDropdown" class="main-menu-container"><ul id="main-menu" class="navbar-nav"><li id="menu-item-516" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-516"><a title="Get Started" href="https://firstrank.ca/application/" class="nav-link">Get Started</a></li><li id="menu-item-790" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children nav-item menu-item-790 dropdown"><a title="About" href="#" data-toggle="dropdown" class="nav-link dropdown-toggle">About <span class="caret"></span></a><ul class=" dropdown-menu" role="menu"><li id="menu-item-957" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-957"><a title="About Us" href="https://firstrank.ca/first-rank-as-a-partner/" class="nav-link">About Us</a></li><li id="menu-item-8027" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type_archive menu-item-object-podcasts nav-item menu-item-8027"><a title="Beyond Page One Podcast" href="https://firstrank.ca/podcasts/" class="nav-link">Beyond Page One Podcast</a></li><li id="menu-item-791" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-791"><a title="Value of SEO" href="https://firstrank.ca/value-of-seo/" class="nav-link">Value of SEO</a></li><li id="menu-item-788" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-788"><a title="Why First Rank?" href="https://firstrank.ca/our-advantage/" class="nav-link">Why First Rank?</a></li><li id="menu-item-787" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-787"><a title="6 Pillar SEO Strategy" href="https://firstrank.ca/6-pillar-approach/" class="nav-link">6 Pillar SEO Strategy</a></li><li id="menu-item-978" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom nav-item menu-item-978"><a title="Case Studies" href="https://firstrank.ca/case-studies/" class="nav-link">Case Studies</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-366" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page current_page_parent nav-item menu-item-366"><a title="Blog" href="https://firstrank.ca/blog/" class="nav-link">Blog</a></li><li id="menu-item-5564" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-has-children nav-item menu-item-5564 dropdown"><a title="Services" href="#" data-toggle="dropdown" class="nav-link dropdown-toggle">Services <span class="caret"></span></a><ul class=" dropdown-menu" role="menu"><li id="menu-item-5566" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-home menu-item-has-children nav-item menu-item-5566 dropdown-submenu"><a title="Search Engine Optimization" href="https://firstrank.ca/" class="nav-link">Search Engine Optimization</a><ul class=" dropdown-menu" role="menu"><li id="menu-item-6137" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-6137"><a title="E-Commerce SEO" href="https://firstrank.ca/e-commerce-services/" class="nav-link">E-Commerce SEO</a></li><li id="menu-item-10386" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-10386"><a title="Squarespace SEO Services" href="https://firstrank.ca/squarespace-seo-services/" class="nav-link">Squarespace SEO Services</a></li><li id="menu-item-10228" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-10228"><a title="WordPress SEO" href="https://firstrank.ca/wordpress-seo/" class="nav-link">WordPress SEO</a></li><li id="menu-item-11027" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-11027"><a title="Wix SEO" href="https://firstrank.ca/wix-seo/" class="nav-link">Wix SEO</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-12345" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-has-children nav-item menu-item-12345 dropdown-submenu"><a title="AI Search Marketing" href="https://firstrank.ca/generative-engine-optimization/" class="nav-link">AI Search Marketing</a><ul class=" dropdown-menu" role="menu"><li id="menu-item-12347" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-12347"><a title="Generative Engine Optimization (GEO)" href="https://firstrank.ca/generative-engine-optimization/" class="nav-link">Generative Engine Optimization (GEO)</a></li><li id="menu-item-12350" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-12350"><a title="Answer Engine Optimization (AEO)" href="https://firstrank.ca/answer-engine-optimization/" class="nav-link">Answer Engine Optimization (AEO)</a></li><li id="menu-item-12346" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-12346"><a title="Google’s AI Overviews Optimization" href="https://firstrank.ca/google-ai-overview/" class="nav-link">Google’s AI Overviews Optimization</a></li><li id="menu-item-12349" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-12349"><a title="SEO for ChatGPT" href="https://firstrank.ca/rank-in-chatgpt/" class="nav-link">SEO for ChatGPT</a></li><li id="menu-item-12351" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-12351"><a title="SEO For Perplexity" href="https://firstrank.ca/rank-in-perplexity/" class="nav-link">SEO For Perplexity</a></li><li id="menu-item-12348" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page nav-item menu-item-12348"><a title="SEO For Gemini" href="https://firstrank.ca/rank-in-gemini/" class="nav-link">SEO For Gemini</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-14348" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children nav-item menu-item-14348 dropdown-submenu">